 "remarks": "Highly sought-after, beautifully updated 2-bedroom, ground floor 2-bath unit with stunning water views and the largest, private patio in the complex overlooking the marina. Features include light-filled, interiors, impeccable hardwood floors, an open living/dining area with a fireplace, and a completely updated kitchen with newer stainless-steel appliances and a beverage/wine fridge. The unit also offers a generous primary suite with a fully renovated bath, a second renovated full bath, and in-unit full-size laundry. Includes reserved garage parking space # 35, a storage locker, and elevator access. Conveniently located near the beach, Cummings Park, downtown, the train station, and I-95.",
